From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Bruno=20Greg=C3=B3rio?= <accounts@bruno.pw>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 18:42:39 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] fixup! WIP: arm64: dts: qcom: sm6450: Add the GPU
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Round 67: the GPU SMMU's probe took a synchronous external abort
writing SMR 1 with stream 1, mask 0x400, valid, after the SMR for
stream 0 went in. Stock maps the GPU's user context at stream 0 and its
secure context at stream 2, and nothing at stream 1, so give the GPU
stream 0 alone.

Signed-off-by: Bruno Gregório <accounts@bruno.pw>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm6450.dtsi | 3 +--
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm6450.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm6450.dtsi
index 6caee643c..a009e2c99 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm6450.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm6450.dtsi
@@ -1027,8 +1027,7 @@ gpu: gpu@3d00000 {
 
 			interrupts = <GIC_SPI 300 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>;
 
-			iommus = <&adreno_smmu 0 0x400>,
-				 <&adreno_smmu 1 0x400>;
+			iommus = <&adreno_smmu 0 0x400>;
 
 			interconnects = <&gem_noc MASTER_GFX3D QCOM_ICC_TAG_ALWAYS
 					 &mc_virt SLAVE_EBI1 QCOM_ICC_TAG_ALWAYS>;
